{"title":"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the limiting sum of the geometric series <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/7/ed715a454ac0c12fe4ec1f9defd361dbd257315f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 - \\frac{8}{3} + \\frac{16}{9} - \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"137\" height=\"38\" />, as the number of terms increases without bound. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f372a7990decaaa11beb00b0f68402c3137ff459.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{a number between } 0 \\text{ and } 1 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2.4 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2.5 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 3.6 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"588\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The infinite sum of a geometric series with first term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and common ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/4/d840d5875a681ce330c96a3ce83740ebd960e589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1&lt;r&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"88\" height=\"12\" />) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/2/d92b8c5d55f66f20ed3f225d99a712796b2efced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{1-r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"33\" />.\nNow, in this geometric series, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7ffa3b8792f0170bce1ab6008e907343100d70e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/c/b7cfa6ee0a2e5a9ff75e0ff789e2b21667304972.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=-\\frac23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" />. Plugging these into the formula, we get \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8de4932ad0f3a38f1813ec6be5e6b979c7bb47a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac4{1-(-\\frac23)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"72\" height=\"43\" />, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/6/e467027e3ae802f1d4b9541ee6b8aa87b55bf12b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12}5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/2/ee2e77b8e79a0426ee11bc192b968554948d62c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2.4\\textbf{ (B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"69\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME\" title=\"1962 AHSME\">1962 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1962 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1962\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>Problem 13</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1962 AHSME Proble